{"id":"math_5","question":"How many diagonals does a convex heptagon have?","gold":"14","trace":"<think>\nDiagonals of n-gon = n(n-3)/2 = 7 * 4 / 2 = 14.\n</think>\nAnswer: 14","answer":"14","meta":{"task":"math"}}
{"id":"math_6","question":"If log_2(x) = 5, what is x?","gold":"32","trace":"<think>\nx = 2^5 = 32.\n</think>\nAnswer: 32","answer":"32","meta":{"task":"math"}}
{"id":"math_7","question":"Find the derivative of sin(x) * cos(x) at x = 0.","gold":"1","trace":"<think>\nd/dx sin(x)cos(x) = cos(2x). At x=0, cos(0) = 1.\n</think>\nAnswer: 1","answer":"1","meta":{"task":"math"}}
{"id":"math_8","question":"What is the greatest common divisor of 48 and 180?","gold":"12","trace":"<think>\ngcd(48,180) via Euclid: 180 = 3*48 + 36; 48 = 1*36 + 12; 36 = 3*12 + 0. GCD = 12.\n</think>\nAnswer: 12","answer":"12","meta":{"task":"math"}}
{"id":"math_9","question":"What is the probability of rolling two dice and getting a sum of 7?","gold":"1/6","trace":"<think>\nFavorable outcomes: (1,6),(2,5),(3,4),(4,3),(5,2),(6,1) = 6. Total = 36. Probability = 6/36 = 1/6.\n</think>\nAnswer: 1/6","answer":"1/6","meta":{"task":"math"}}
